   "excerpt": "Rhubarb and custard, lemon verbena, the first strawberries from Fife.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">Rhubarb and custard, lemon verbena, the first strawberries from Fife.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rhubarb and custard</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lemon verbena</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strawberry <sup>vg</sup></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buttermilk</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pea and mint (we tried)</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sour cherry sorbet <sup>vg</sup></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hazelnut praline</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-flavour\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-flavour\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Honeycomb</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-note\">a special for June</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-spec\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-spec\">Specials change on the first Tuesday</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-note\">What we learned: pea and mint was a mistake. We made it once.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"/menu/\">This month's menu</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "src": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rhubarb and custard, lemon verbena, the first strawberries from Fife.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Rhubarb and custard</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lemon verbena</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strawberry (vg)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Buttermilk</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pea and mint (we tried)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sour cherry sorbet (vg)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hazelnut praline</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Honeycomb</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What we learned: pea and mint was a mistake. We made it once.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
