  {
   "title": "Why the pistachio is brownish green",
   "category": "notes",
   "image": "pistachios.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Our pistachio is brownish green because it is 12% Bronte pistachio paste and nothing else. Here is the recipe.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our pistachio is brownish green because it is 12% Bronte pistachio paste and nothing else. Here is the recipe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Whole milk, 62%</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bronte pistachio paste, 12%</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sugar and dextrose, 17%</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cream, 6%</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Skimmed milk powder, 3%</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bright green pistachio gelato is coloured. Ours goes slightly darker as the week goes on, which is how you know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "The batch freezer, explained",
   "category": "notes",
   "image": "affogato.jpg",
   "excerpt": "We churn in a horizontal batch freezer that makes 6 litres in 10 minutes. This is what that means for texture.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We churn in a horizontal batch freezer that makes 6 litres in 10 minutes. This is what that means for texture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Base goes in at 4 °C</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It comes out at −8 °C, soft</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hardened at −25 °C for 40 minutes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Served at −12 °C</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The faster a base freezes, the smaller the ice crystals. That is most of what makes gelato smooth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  }
